message: "If you use Empiria, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Empiria: A Composable, Browser-Based Environment for Simulation-Based Statistics Education"
abstract: >-
  Empiria is a free, open-source, browser-based environment for
  simulation-based statistics education. It represents the inferential
  workflow as a composable dataflow graph: small modules ("nodes") are wired
  together with cables, a global clock advances the computation, and every
  intermediate quantity updates in real time — optionally beside the live
  mathematical formula each node computes. Its numerical routines use exact
  recipes verified against R.
